00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:06.966
I was like,
"Jimmy used to hold you."

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:10.436
-Yeah! Pearl! I sang to you!

00:01:10.436 --> 00:01:14.374
-This is, like, our first
real, yeah, "vacation."

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:16.609
-Wow.
-I know.

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:17.977
-Because you were
coming back and forth,

00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:20.946
L.A. to New York,
