-Thank you. Thank you.

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:27.320
Yeah.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:28.854
-Did you get --
Did you receive the Emmy?

00:01:28.854 --> 00:01:30.456
'Cause I know
you didn't get one in person.

00:01:30.456 --> 00:01:32.425
