and the first one I got

00:01:46.572 --> 00:01:48.207
was for "Big Mouth."
And we open it up --

00:01:48.207 --> 00:01:49.909
-That's right. Your voice.

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:52.745
-Yeah, but I didn't know
that it said

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:56.215
