happened in this building.

00:02:30.116 --> 00:02:33.319
-Yes. That's correct.
-Yeah.

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:36.389
Did you have Pearl when
Prince was musical guest?

00:02:36.389 --> 00:02:39.759
-You know what? I was on
maternity leave actually when --

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:42.094
I didn't know
when I was coming back,

00:02:42.094 --> 00:02:44.129
