that day.

00:06:29.087 --> 00:06:31.424
-You brought the anthrax.
-No. I did not bring anthrax.

00:06:31.424 --> 00:06:33.826
That is a rumor.
But I did go to Starbucks.

00:06:33.826 --> 00:06:35.827
I came like everything
was normal.

00:06:35.827 --> 00:06:37.062
Like, "Duh-da-da."
I got Starbucks.

00:06:37.062 --> 00:06:38.597
-Yeah, normal day.
-I walk up to the 8th floor,

00:06:38.597 --> 00:06:40.232
