in the hazmat suits.

00:06:40.232 --> 00:06:41.734
And I go,
"What sketch is this?"

00:06:41.734 --> 00:06:43.836
They're like, "Dude, you
shouldn't have been here.

00:06:43.836 --> 00:06:45.771
You didn't check your messages
or whatever?"

00:06:45.771 --> 00:06:47.807
I was like, "What's going on?"
-Yeah, my cousin called me

00:06:47.807 --> 00:06:49.107
and said,
"Your building is on the news.

00:06:49.107 --> 00:06:51.510
Are you going into work today?"

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:54.546
"Uh, I guess so?"
-Yeah. What bizarre times.

00:06:54.546 --> 00:06:56.248
-Bizarre times.
But you know what?

00:06:56.248 --> 00:07:00.519
This place that we know so well,
it's been nice to be here.

00:07:00.519 --> 00:07:03.455
Coming back and forth
doing the show for the election

00:07:03.455 --> 00:07:05.825
