[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:22.441 --> 00:07:24.677
-We're gonna get back.
We're gonna get back.

00:07:24.677 --> 00:07:26.112
Guys, Maya Rudolph, everyone.

00:07:26.112 --> 00:07:27.813
She's hosting
"Saturday Night Live"

00:07:27.813 --> 00:07:30.383
